/section></div></div><div data-dot-object="contentlet"><div class=""><section class="px-4 py-15 lg:py-20 relative"><div class="container"><div class="w-full max-w-lg transition-all relative ease-in duration-700 opacity-0 top-5"><p class="mb-3 font-bold text-sm leading-[16px] md:mb-6 tracking-widest uppercase text-primary-teal">WHO WE SERVE</p><h2 class="text-primary-dark text-3xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold mb-3">See what Lennox can do for you</h2><div class="[&amp;&gt;p]:!text-lg"><p class="text-primary-grey-60 text-base mb-4 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;a]:text-primary-red [&amp;&gt;a]:hover:underline">Lennox combines highly efficient equipment and advanced controls with personalized guidance to enable solutions that are better for business, people and the planet.</p></div><div class="mt-6 flex gap-4 lg:mt-12"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 undefined w-full md:w-auto"><a class="cursor-pointer font-bold rounded-lg tracking-[1px] transition-all uppercase gap-2 focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-primary-red-30 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-primary-red text-white ring-1 ring-primary-red w-full md:w-auto flex justify-center md:justify-start hover:bg-primary-red-50 hover:ring-primary-red-50 active:bg-primary-red-60 active:ring-primary-red-60 disabled:bg-primary-dark-10 disabled:border-primary-dark-10 disabled:ring-primary-dark-10 disabled:text-primary-grey-50 text-base py-[12px] px-6 leading-5" target="_self" href="/commercial/who-we-serve">Discover All</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="px-4 pb-15 lg:pb-20"><div class="container space-y-16 lg:space-y-24"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-y-12 lg:gap-x-20"><div class="col-start-1 col-end-2 row-start-1 row-end-2 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-x-4 "></div><div class="max-size-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"></div></div></div></section></div></div><div data-dot-object="contentlet"></div><div data-dot-object="contentlet"><div class="relative bg-primary-light-grey"><section class="px-4 pt-15 pb-15 sm:pb-96 lg:py-20"><div class="container relative space-y-16 lg:space-y-24"></div></section></div></div><div data-dot-object="contentlet"><div class="relative bg-black"><img alt="Image" loading="lazy" width="2048" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-cover w-full h-full absolute top-0 start-0 object-bottom" style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 100vw, 100vw" srcSet="/dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/640w/webp_q/75 640w, /dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/750w/webp_q/75 750w, /dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/828w/webp_q/75 828w, /dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/1080w/webp_q/75 1080w, /dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/1200w/webp_q/75 1200w, /dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/1920w/webp_q/75 1920w, /dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/2048w/webp_q/75 2048w, /dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/3840w/webp_q/75 3840w" src="/dA/acb234a77ab2e0ba79b8759d9cd2a201/3840w/webp_q/75"/><section class="relative px-4 py-15 lg:py-20"><div class="container lg:text-center"><div class="transition-all relative ease-in duration-500 space-y-3 mx-auto max-w-[900px] opacity-0 top-5"><div><p class="mb-3 font-bold text-sm leading-[16px] md:mb-4 tracking-widest text-white">FEATURED</p><h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-white text-center md:text-center">Varix™ VRF Systems</h2></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="[&amp;&gt;p]:!text-lg [&amp;&gt;*]:!text-primary-light-grey [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:!text-primary-light-grey [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:underline [&amp;&gt;p&gt;a]:hover:underline-none"><p class="text-primary-grey-60 text-base mb-4 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;a]:text-primary-red [&amp;&gt;a]:hover:underline">As part of our Lennox powered by Samsung offering, Varix VRF Systems combine the direct speed, service and support of Lennox with Samsung’s innovative ductless technology. The joint venture delivers forward-thinking solutions to North America, ready to help you meet rising demands for efficiency, control and flexibility.</p></div><div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-x-4 md:mt-8"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4  w-full md:w-auto"><a class="cursor-pointer font-bold rounded-lg tracking-[1px] transition-all uppercase gap-2 focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-primary-red-30 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-transparent ring-1 ring-white focus:outline-none w-full md:w-auto flex justify-center text-white hover:bg-white/20 active:bg-white/20 active:ring-white/50 active:text-white/50 focus:bg-white/20 text-base py-[12px] px-6 leading-5" target="_self" href="/commercial/product-info/varix-vrf">LEARN MORE</a></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div data-dot-object="contentlet"><section class="px-4 py-15 lg:py-20"><div class="container"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-6 items-center md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-12 lg:gap-x-20"><div><img alt="Image" loading="lazy" width="2048" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-cover w-full h-full " style="color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/384w/webp_q/75 384w, /dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/640w/webp_q/75 640w, /dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/750w/webp_q/75 750w, /dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/828w/webp_q/75 828w, /dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/1080w/webp_q/75 1080w, /dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/1200w/webp_q/75 1200w, /dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/1920w/webp_q/75 1920w, /dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/2048w/webp_q/75 2048w, /dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/3840w/webp_q/75 3840w" src="/dA/b5d94001500ed2f9474c0b4502338826/3840w/webp_q/75"/></div><div class="transition-all relative ease-in duration-700 opacity-0 left-5"><p class="mb-3 font-bold text-sm leading-[16px] md:mb-4 tracking-widest text-primary-teal">CONTRACTOR</p><h3 class="text-primary-dark text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold mb-3">Find a Lennox 